<title>MEXICO: GMexico details Q1 zinc, lead sales vols.</title>
<headline>GMexico details Q1 zinc, lead sales vols.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Mexico (GMexico), Mexico's largest mining company, detailed on Monday sales volumes of base metals in the first quarter of 1997 with comparative figures from previous quarters.</p>
<p>Figures are in tonnes, change is in percentage</p>
<p>    Metal     Q197	Q196	Chge	Q496	  Chge</p>
<p>    Zinc     32,939    35,297     -6.7    37,852	 -13.0</p>
<p>    Lead	8,708     7,778     12.0     7,918	  10.0</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530)) E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
</text>
